      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:PsCnFor">Ps Cn for</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Ps Cn for 24" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="624" ed="#liebermann"/>Sed si regalem feram, quam Angli a staggon appellant, alteruter coegerit anhelare, alter per unum annum, alter per duos careat libertate naturali; si uero seruus, pro utlagato habeatur, quem Angli frendlæsman uocant.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 624 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
